        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...Traitors.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sui"
    },
    {
        "text": "You twelve, each and every one of you, plan to betray me, yes?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sui"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#11$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Indeed. None of us will submit to becoming a part of you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wang"
    },
    {
        "text": "We have lived as ourselves. This is why we are different from you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wang"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2129_1#11$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Lived as... humans?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sui"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2129_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You see yourselves as human, and try to bring delusions varied to bear against me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sui"
    },
    {
        "text": "You relied on the power you stole from me, ingratiating yourselves with those puny insects, but you still had to humble yourselves, hiding your claws and fangs to make yourselves look harmless.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sui"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is that what you mean by living as a human?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sui"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You still do not understand... You can never understand, for you have never lived.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wang"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#11$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "And I am well-aware... from where your arrogance stems.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wang"
    },
    {
        "text": "With but a glance, you can look from the beginning of time to its end. Though your consciousness has traversed the great void for eons, you have never had kin you could converse with.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wang"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You are simply a god declaring Itself supreme over a pitiful plot of empty space.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wang"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know full well what this feeling was like."
    },
    {
        "text": "Until the day someone gave me a name."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#11$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You are nobody's fate... Not the people of this land, or we twelve.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wang"
    },
    {
        "text": "And there is one thing you will never understand: against someone who already has nothing to his name...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wang"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Fate is utterly powerless.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wang"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2129_1#11$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Very well... Since you dare to repeat your foolish challenge, I do not mind shattering your delusions once more.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sui"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2129_1#12$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I killed you once a hundred-and-twenty years ago! I shall kill you again with but a flick of my wrist!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sui"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#11$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is that meant to scare me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wang"
    },
    {
        "text": "I am already accustomed to losing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wang"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2129_1#11$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sui"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#11$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have already lost too many precious, precious things. I have lost the entire board.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wang"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "My dignity, my honor, my trust, my freedom, myself."
    },
    {
        "text": "My family."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#11$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did you really think someone with nothing more to lose would be afraid?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wang"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wang"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you not afraid you will suffer another ignominious defeat, like a thousand years ago?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wang"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is this fear not what makes you hesitate to step forward?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wang"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2129_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...A jest, at this hour!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sui"
    },
    {
        "text": "You desire in vain to replace me, to steal away my body. Why would I allow you to do as you please?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sui"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2129_1#12$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I need only stir this body awake first\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sui"
    },
    {
