    {
        "text": "The Feranmut extends Its talons, talons as great as mountains."
    },
    {
        "text": "Countless Feranmuts in countless Tombs extend Their talons, countless talons as great as mountains, and point them towards the same proxy."
    },
    {
        "text": "It does not matter if this is a dream. So long as that loathsome face is wiped away in all of them, there will be nothing left to stop Its awakening."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
