        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sui"
    },
    {
        "text": "What is this...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sui"
    },
    {
        "text": "An incomparably brutal blow slams into Its body. A strength It is familiar with."
    },
    {
        "text": "It knows, that in this split-second, It has lost Its connection with Its enormous body."
    },
    {
        "text": "Who could cause such harm to Its form?!"
    },
