    },
    {
        "text": "Why are you\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wang"
    },
    {
        "text": "Always so meddlesome!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wang"
    },
    {
        "text": "I knew you would say that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chongyue"
    },
    {
        "text": "I also promised that, were things to arrive at this stage, I will be with you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chongyue"
    },
    {
        "text": "Besides, I also wanted to bring her to meet you, to let you know that all your years of planning... were not for naught.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chongyue"
    },
    {
        "text": "Through the boundary between dream and reality, Wang sees the token Chongyue clutches to his bosom..."
    },
    {
        "text": "And then, their eyes meet."
    },
    {
        "text": "You should leave...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wang"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chongyue"
    },
    {
        "text": "Live.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chongyue"
    },
    {
        "text": "Live, and come back to us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chongyue"
    },
    {
        "text": "I will not make you any promises.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wang"
    },
    {
        "text": "The distance between them stretches with speed."
    },
    {
        "text": "Even though he is a Grandmaster of kung fu, a thousand years old, a human body is still only a human body."
    },
    {
        "text": "The force piercing the veil between truth and fiction quickly dissipates, but the voice of that brother Wang is so fed up with still reaches his ears."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
