        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2129_1#11$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What did he... What did he do?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sui"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2129_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But it does not matter! IT DOES NOT MATTER! No matter what he did, it was only for an instant... AN INSTANT!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sui"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1.5,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 50,
        "randomness": 50,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_hugemonsterroar_long",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2129_1#12$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No longer shall he disturb us! Nor will any of your ludicrous, insignificant... <i>siblings!</i>",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sui"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is my dream, with only you and I!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sui"
    },
    {
        "text": "I thought I would have to bring all my strength to bear to defeat you, but it seems you are still weak, still liable to collapse at the slightest of breezes. You only have a single stone left...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sui"
    },
    {
        "text": "I will barely even have to lift my finger... to crush you! To annihilate you!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sui"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2129_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "And those poems, those laws, those martial arts... Such irksome pests. I need only use the strength I saved for you to isolate you from those meddlesome insects!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sui"
    },
    {
        "text": "You are unfit to die by my claws. You are only fit to be cut down by your reflection's blade... Now DIE!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sui"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hah... Is that so?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wang"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
