    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 3
    },
    {
        "text": "To die is your end, not mine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wang"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes. In all these causal chains, in all these possibilities, in all these dreams, you will die.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wang"
    },
    {
        "text": "These countless repetitions within this dream have eroded away, hollowed out your most frenzied imaginings. And all without you knowing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wang"
    },
    {
        "text": "Have you not noticed how intricately linked you and I are to this dream you used to trap me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wang"
    },
    {
        "text": "You have been chained by your hateful, vengeful impulses... Your evolution has reached its end.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wang"
    },
    {
        "text": "And we have already surpassed you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wang"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "But your body will persist.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wang"
    },
    {
        "text": "I... will take your place.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wang"
    },
    {
        "text": "And how will you do that? With your isolated stones, and with your own body, so ready to fall apart?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sui"
    },
    {
        "text": "You dare assume... I only have my stones... and this body of mine?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wang"
    },
    {
        "text": "The near-dead proxy uses the last of his strength to lift his sword."
    },
    {
        "text": "The deranged Feranmut gives one last howl of rage."
    },
